Extension-Test:
`extension.test.ts` tests activate() success & auth failure
; deactivate() disposals
; config change handler: pyops config only, refresh providers/timers based on hasValidConfig()
; debug terminate: cancel job via API if jobId
; command handlers: 20+ commands via registerCommand capture in beforeAll, mock instances from globals.

Service-Tests:
JobService.test.ts: CRUD ops, bulk cancel/delete, viewJob polling with stdout/stderr updates & state transitions (done/failed/cancelled/remove/404), error handling for all async methods, undefined provider handling, timer cleanup.
; ScriptletService.test.ts: local/remote sync ops, network error handling, filesystem branch tests (existsSync conditions), multi-step error scenarios.
; DebugService.test.ts: buildOverrides, enqueueDebugJob
; DebugOutputMonitor.test.ts: start/stop monitoring & polling (incremental stdout/stderr append, show channels, stop on done/failed/cancelled/remove/404, fetch error log).
; RefreshTimerManager.test.ts: ensureRunning, stopIfRunning
; AuthService.test.ts: setupAuth prompts/storage
; PyOpsPythonDebugConfigProvider.test.ts: config provision.

Provider-Tests:
managerTreeProvider.test.ts: getTreeItem/Children API fetch/download, error handling for fetchScriptlets/downloadScriptlets, refresh graceful failure.
; jobsTreeProvider.test.ts: job states bulk ops
; RemoteContentProvider.test.ts: provideTextDocumentContent, registerRemoteLanguageModeSetter conditional logic, missing language mappings, event emitter access.

Utility-Tests:
utils.test.ts: inferExt all switch cases including unknown types, hasValidConfig false paths (empty/undefined/null serverUrl).

Other-Tests:
apiClient.test.ts: API calls with auth
; ConnectionStatusManager.test.ts: status bar updates
; CreateScriptletCommand.test.ts: command execution.

Test-Mocking:
Hoisted jest.mock('../src/services/*') with mockImplementation for instances/methods
; dynamic require for overrides
; vscode mocks: window.createOutputChannel, workspace.getConfiguration etc.
; global.fetch for API, fs/path mocks for filesystem ops.

Global-Attributes:
Tests use beforeAll for shared activate/setup; beforeEach(jest.clearAllMocks())
; no autouse fixtures; isolation via mocks/clear.
; run: `npm run test --prefix vsix/`
; focus on error paths, edge cases, complex conditional logic for branch coverage.
